today marks eight years since a tragic  day in the valley officers igrisaldo and  alan beck were ambushed and killed by an  anti-government couple while they were  eating lunch the two shooters then  opened fire at a nearby walmart and  killed joseph wilcox who tried to stop  them the couple later took their own  lives during a standoff with police  there is now a park named in memory of  officer beck in the northwest valley
 

